WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,820
Come in Boss

2
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,460
If you need anything, just give me an order

3
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:05,740
Secretary General is too busy today

4
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:08,300
I can't be with you in person as long as you are here

5
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:09,940
He can be relieved in these two days.

6
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:11,340
The secretary-general is indeed too busy

7
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:12,740
I will help him well in the future

8
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:15,000
There will be guests coming soon

9
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,160
Just stand aside and remember to bring tea and water.

10
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:24,200
Ignore whatever he asked you to do. Okay, my assistant will pour the tea.

11
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:30,170
This little girl looks fresh to the Boss

12
00:00:30,330 --> 00:00:31,410
where did you get it

13
00:00:31,650 --> 00:00:34,050
Internships recruited by the company

14
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:36,810
That means it can be eaten. Leave it to me.

15
00:00:36,970 --> 00:00:38,650
I happen to be short of someone to serve tea and pour water over there.

16
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:39,570
This is not good for you, okay?

17
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:40,970
I want to eat back to my own territory

18
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:42,170
Don't worry about my territory

19
00:00:42,370 --> 00:00:43,850
The rules here are not for you

20
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:45,370
What's yours and mine

21
00:00:45,530 --> 00:00:46,810
food is food

22
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:48,330
They are our food

23
00:00:48,730 --> 00:00:49,770
Don't be so stingy

24
00:00:50,010 --> 00:00:52,250
Otherwise, how can we cooperate in the future? I’m sorry.

25
00:00:52,370 --> 00:00:53,850
I am a very territorial person

26
00:00:53,850 --> 00:00:55,410
It's not allowed on my disk

27
00:00:55,610 --> 00:00:57,250
You don’t have to be the one to cooperate with

28
00:00:57,370 --> 00:00:58,730
I chose you because you are a good deal

29
00:00:59,090 --> 00:01:00,850
Don't forget you are never the only one

30
00:01:01,170 --> 00:01:03,970
It seems we can't talk anymore today. Let's go slowly without seeing you off.
